{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44129714",
      "title": "Getting Access to the Angular-managed Form",
      "lectureOrder": 244,
      "videoOrder": 232,
      "sourceHash": "72becdf5d3e0e5d06b6b2eaf8ec726d24be339335e3dcf94ab708b487ed9d22f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 2.94,
          "en": "So, we're using the template driven",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.94,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "forms management approach here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "And for a start, we registered two input elements with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 10.203,
          "en": "of ngModel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.58,
          "end": 16.29,
          "en": "But currently, we don't have any way of accessing this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 18.6,
          "en": "that's handled by Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 21.69,
          "en": "and we have no way of getting hold or getting access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.69,
          "end": 26.49,
          "en": "to these input elements that we registered with Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.49,
          "end": 28.59,
          "en": "Well, we can change that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.59,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "Because we can now add a template variable to this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 35.67,
          "en": "and give it any name of your choice like \"form,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.67,
          "end": 38.01,
          "en": "but the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.01,
          "end": 39.93,
          "en": "Now, we did something like that earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.93,
          "end": 42.72,
          "en": "in the course already, and if you do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.72,
          "end": 46.89,
          "en": "you would get access to the HTML form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.89,
          "end": 50.52,
          "en": "So to the DOM object that is created behind the scenes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.52,
          "end": 53.403,
          "en": "for this form HTML element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.69,
          "end": 59.69,
          "en": "Here however, I want to get access to this form object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.85,
          "end": 63.24,
          "en": "that will be created and managed by Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.24,
          "end": 64.41,
          "en": "behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.41,
          "end": 68.88,
          "en": "Because Angular will actually also detect that you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.88,
          "end": 70.92,
          "en": "a form element in your template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.92,
          "end": 74.193,
          "en": "if you are importing this forms module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.06,
          "end": 77.7,
          "en": "Because that's something else this module will do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "It essentially registers a directive that has this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 84.15,
          "en": "form element selector as a selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.15,
          "end": 88.65,
          "en": "so that Angular can control form elements like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.65,
          "end": 92.03999999999999,
          "en": "And Angular also gives us a syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.03999999999999,
          "end": 95.7,
          "en": "a special syntax we can use on those template variables",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.7,
          "end": 100.25999999999999,
          "en": "to store some other kind of value in that variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.25999999999999,
          "end": 103.65,
          "en": "instead of that default value which would be stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.65,
          "end": 104.72999999999999,
          "en": "by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.72999999999999,
          "end": 107.463,
          "en": "So instead of storing this HTML form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.66,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "Because you can assign a value to a template variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 115.74000000000001,
          "en": "like this, but the value assigned here is then not the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.74000000000001,
          "end": 118.53,
          "en": "that would be stored in there, but instead it can be some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.53,
          "end": 123.48,
          "en": "special identifier that might be exposed by some directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.48,
          "end": 127.65,
          "en": "or component that then binds this template variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.65,
          "end": 131.64,
          "en": "to some other value than the default value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.64,
          "end": 135,
          "en": "In this case, since I'm adding the form template variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135,
          "end": 138.3,
          "en": "on the form element, which as I just explained,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.3,
          "end": 141.09,
          "en": "is managed by Angular under the hood",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.09,
          "end": 144.24,
          "en": "thanks to this directive that is provided by the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.24,
          "end": 145.65,
          "en": "form's module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.65,
          "end": 150.65,
          "en": "If I'm doing that, I can use the ngForm identifier here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.11,
          "end": 154.23,
          "en": "That's a special identifier offered by Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.23,
          "end": 157.14,
          "en": "offered by its form directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 157.14,
          "end": 160.44,
          "en": "which will now bind this form template variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.44,
          "end": 162.617,
          "en": "to an object of type ngForm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.82999999999998,
          "end": 167.34,
          "en": "which is an object created and managed by Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.34,
          "end": 170.487,
          "en": "as you can tell by its name starting with \"NG.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.2,
          "end": 176.01,
          "en": "And that is now that form object that is automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 178.53,
          "en": "created behind the scenes by Angular;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.53,
          "end": 182.22,
          "en": "and it's this behind the scenes managed forms object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.22,
          "end": 184.74,
          "en": "to which these inputs are registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 187.023,
          "en": "if you add ngModel on them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.28,
          "end": 191.31,
          "en": "So therefore, now this form template variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.31,
          "end": 195.03,
          "en": "stores this Angular managed form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 195.03,
          "end": 198.27,
          "en": "And you can probably tell why this approach is called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.27,
          "end": 201.84,
          "en": "the template driven approach, because I'm doing all that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 201.84,
          "end": 204.81,
          "en": "setup work here in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.81,
          "end": 207.48,
          "en": "I registered these inputs in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 207.48,
          "end": 212.22,
          "en": "and I got access to that Angular managed form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.22,
          "end": 213.303,
          "en": "in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.77,
          "end": 218.61,
          "en": "But now we can ensure that we also get access to this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 218.61,
          "end": 221.64,
          "en": "in our component class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 221.64,
          "end": 225.72,
          "en": "by either getting hold of this element with help of the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 225.72,
          "end": 229.11,
          "en": "view child function or decorator, as you learned it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 229.11,
          "end": 230.253,
          "en": "before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 236.1,
          "en": "or by passing this variable onto some method that may be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 236.1,
          "end": 238.86,
          "en": "executed when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.86,
          "end": 240.783,
          "en": "And I'll do the latter here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 241.98,
          "end": 244.8,
          "en": "I'll add this ngSubmit event handler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.8,
          "end": 248.1,
          "en": "about which you learned earlier in the course already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.1,
          "end": 251.853,
          "en": "which is another forms related feature offered by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 252.75,
          "end": 255.39,
          "en": "And I then want to trigger some onSubmit method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 255.39,
          "end": 260.39,
          "en": "and pass my form variable here as an argument to onSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 263.55,
          "end": 266.25,
          "en": "So therefore, in the login component we can and should now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 266.25,
          "end": 268.68,
          "en": "add this onSubmit method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 268.68,
          "end": 271.89,
          "en": "And there I expect to get a parameter, and I'll name it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 271.89,
          "end": 276,
          "en": "form here as well, though this name here doesn't need to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 276,
          "end": 278.07,
          "en": "the same name as I chose here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 278.07,
          "end": 281.19,
          "en": "but I will go for form here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 281.19,
          "end": 283.937,
          "en": "And the type of this parameter will be ngForm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.83,
          "end": 289.83299999999997,
          "en": "which must be imported from @angular/forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 291.78,
          "end": 294.78,
          "en": "And we can tell that we'll get an argument of this type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.78,
          "end": 297.57,
          "en": "if we go back to the template and we hover over this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 297.57,
          "end": 299.22,
          "en": "template variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 299.22,
          "end": 302.027,
          "en": "There, we learned that it will be of type ngForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 303.78,
          "end": 305.91,
          "en": "And since I'm passing that to onSubmit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 305.91,
          "end": 309.21,
          "en": "we'll get a parameter of that type as an input there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 309.21,
          "end": 310.14300000000003,
          "en": "in this method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 311.25,
          "end": 313.92,
          "en": "Well, and now I'll simply log it to the console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 313.92,
          "end": 318.92,
          "en": "so that we can see what's inside of such an ngForm object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 320.1,
          "end": 324.03,
          "en": "So what's inside of this behind the scenes Angular managed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 324.03,
          "end": 325.323,
          "en": "forms object?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 326.19,
          "end": 329.7,
          "en": "Therefore, if I saved it all, and I then enter some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 329.7,
          "end": 334.65,
          "en": "values here, and I click log in, you'll see this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 334.65,
          "end": 335.97,
          "en": "gets logged here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 335.97,
          "end": 339.93,
          "en": "And if we expand it, we can see that it's definitely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 339.93,
          "end": 343.35,
          "en": "a more complex object, which we haven't created,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 343.35,
          "end": 346.113,
          "en": "but which instead was created by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 347.07,
          "end": 350.90999999999997,
          "en": "And you can tell that it's a object that has a form key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 350.90999999999997,
          "end": 353.25,
          "en": "for example, a property named form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 353.25,
          "end": 356.433,
          "en": "which holds another object of type form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 357.3,
          "end": 358.86,
          "en": "And we can expand that as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 358.86,
          "end": 362.34,
          "en": "And we see that such a formed group then contains some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 362.34,
          "end": 364.11,
          "en": "controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 364.11,
          "end": 367.35,
          "en": "An errors key, which at the moment is null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 367.35,
          "end": 371.16,
          "en": "Then some other properties that, for example, tell us that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 371.16,
          "end": 373.98,
          "en": "it's not a pristine form anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 373.98,
          "end": 377.19,
          "en": "so that it has been touched by the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 377.19,
          "end": 379.263,
          "en": "that it has been changed by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 380.16,
          "end": 383.85,
          "en": "And we also got a value property, which is an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 383.85,
          "end": 388.85,
          "en": "that has two keys that match the names we chose here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 390.03,
          "end": 392.01,
          "en": "in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 392.01,
          "end": 394.40999999999997,
          "en": "And that's, of course, no coincidence.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 394.40999999999997,
          "end": 398.4,
          "en": "Instead, the names you chose here are the names of these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 398.4,
          "end": 400.02,
          "en": "values here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 400.02,
          "end": 404.79,
          "en": "Because these values are populated and set by the ngModel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 404.79,
          "end": 406.68,
          "en": "directive in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 406.68,
          "end": 410.19,
          "en": "So this ngModel directive works together with this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 410.19,
          "end": 413.97,
          "en": "form directive that's provided by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 413.97,
          "end": 417.3,
          "en": "So that proves that these inputs were registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 417.3,
          "end": 418.92,
          "en": "with this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 418.92,
          "end": 421.74,
          "en": "Because, of course, there I also find the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 421.74,
          "end": 422.853,
          "en": "I just entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 424.14,
          "end": 427.29,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could have also expanded this controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 427.29,
          "end": 430.23,
          "en": "property here, which also holds an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 430.23,
          "end": 434.703,
          "en": "which has one key value pair per input we registered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 435.66,
          "end": 438.54,
          "en": "Where we also again find our names,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 438.54,
          "end": 443.19,
          "en": "and then we see that they're of type FormControl in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 443.19,
          "end": 447.15,
          "en": "And then for every input, we got some detailed information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
